iga-surface3d-curved.out
3D IGA surface (bspline3dsurfaceelement): doubly curved patch, surface tension and membrane, rigid motion
StaticStructural nsteps 1 deltat 1.0 rtolv 1.e-11 maxiter 10 nmodules 1
errorcheck
domain 3d
OutputManager tstep_all dofman_all element_all
ndofman 48 nelem 4 ncrosssect 2 nmat 2 nbc 37 nic 0 nltf 1 nset 37
# Four copies of one doubly curved B-spline patch (degrees 2 x 2, two knot spans in u, 3 x 3 Gauss points
# per span) in a general orientation, all displacements prescribed. Elements 1 and 2 have surface tension
# only (E = gamma * current area): element 1 a general deformation, element 2 the rigid motion x = Q X + c
# (Q: 1.1 rad about (-1, 0.5, 2), c = (0.3, -0.2, 0.1)). Elements 3 and 4 have the full membrane material,
# element 3 in the reference configuration, element 4 under the same rigid motion.
